# condor_submit_dag uninformed_decade.dag : the statistical model of the masks of uninformed_masks_model.ipynb
# (starsim codes+tests) trained on the decade, with the SDO masks of noise_th = 8, I_th = 0.8, A_th = 10 at 1024 px
# (hmi.M_45s; settings_uninformed.sh), everything in ${BASE}/uninformed_decade:
#   1. the SDO masks of every day, in 40 blocks of days (uninformed_maps.sub)
#   2. the training: statistics of the decade, fit of the generator, closed loop and calibrations on windows spread
#      over the decade; model/model.json (uninformed_train.sub; it runs even if some days failed)
#   3. 3 months of synthetic masks at the solar minimum and maximum, compared with SDO (uninformed_synth.sub)
JOB maps   uninformed_maps.sub
JOB train  uninformed_train.sub
JOB synth  uninformed_synth.sub
PARENT maps  CHILD train
PARENT train CHILD synth
SCRIPT POST maps /bin/true
